he bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 3 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry ${c}_{32}\\ne 0$ (condition II is violated). \n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $B$ and $C$ are **not** in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186339127 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aad04b9e-e1c0-5bb1-8988-f13ae2b12a53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467944} {:answer/id #uuid "182256c0-eed4-5308-8899-646442169606" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467945}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aad04b9e-e1c0-5bb1-8988-f13ae2b12a53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467944} :answer-field/id #uuid "e337cd9d-13a4-5dac-9234-3d41da87d9a0" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468693} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0777136a-d863-5438-b95f-bc866c333a22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467946} {:answer/id #uuid "96cecc84-650b-5579-bf1d-d6d830e791b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467947}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "96cecc84-650b-5579-bf1d-d6d830e791b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467947} :answer-field/id #uuid "a790397a-6735-5a19-8785-3d13a0ca79b8" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 & 6 & 10 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-fi